<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AlMasterclass - Learn From The Best</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
            background: #000;
            color: #fff;
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .header-content {
            max-width: 1440px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 24px 48px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: -1.5px;
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .logo-mark {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 14px 36px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: #fff;
            color: #000;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #f0f0f0;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
        }

        .btn-ghost {
            background: transparent;
            color: #fff;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        }

        .btn-ghost:hover {
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }

        .hero {
            padding: 200px 48px 100px;
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 84px;
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1.05;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            letter-spacing: -3px;
        }

        .gradient {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: 22px;
            color: #999;
            margin-bottom: 48px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-weight: 400;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .cta-group {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 80px;
        }

        .stats-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 60px;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 100px auto 0;
            padding: 0 48px;
        }

        .stat {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .stat-value {
            font-size: 56px;
            font-weight: 900;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
        }

        .stat-label {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        }

        .features-section {
            max-width: 1440px;
            margin: 140px auto;
            padding: 0 48px;
        }

        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 32px;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: #0a0a0a;
            border: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 48px;
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
        }

        .feature-card:hover {
            border-color: #333;
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        }

        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 52px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .feature-card h3 {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .feature-card p {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #999;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .features-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 52px;
            }
            .hero-subtitle {
                font-size: 18px;
            }
            .stats-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
                gap: 40px;
            }
            .features-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .cta-group {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            .header-content {
                padding: 20px;
            }
            .hero {
                padding: 160px 20px 80px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="header">
        <div class="header-content">
            <a href="/" class="logo">
                <div class="logo-mark">A</div>
                AlMasterclass
            </a>
            <nav class="nav-links">
                <% if (user) { %>
                    <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-primary">Dashboard</a>
                <% } else { %>
                    <a href="/login" class="btn btn-ghost">Sign In</a>
                    <a href="/join" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started</a>
                <% } %>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>
            Build Wealth<br>
            <span class="gradient">Without Losing Your Soul</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">
            Join 2,000+ Muslims learning to create success the halal way.<br>
            From eviction to $10M in sales. Now it's your turn.
        </p>

        <div class="cta-group">
            <a href="/join" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 20px 56px; font-size: 17px;">Start Learning Free</a>
        </div>

        <div class="stats-grid">
            <div class="stat">
                <div class="stat-value">$10M+</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Generated</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
                <div class="stat-value">2,000+</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Students</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
                <div class="stat-value">30+</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Wells Built</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
                <div class="stat-value">40+</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Countries</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="features-section">
        <div class="features-grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🎓</div>
                <h3>World-Class Training</h3>
                <p>Learn from proven strategies that generated $10M+ in sales. Battle-tested methods that actually work.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">💰</div>
                <h3>Earn While You Learn</h3>
                <p>Share your link and earn 30% recurring commissions for life. Build passive income as you grow.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🤝</div>
                <h3>Global Community</h3>
                <p>Connect with thousands of Muslim entrepreneurs building wealth together across 40+ countries.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🕌</div>
                <h3>Faith-Centered</h3>
                <p>Build success without compromising your Islamic values. Wealth creation the halal way.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🚀</div>
                <h3>Proven Methods</h3>
                <p>From eviction to empire. Learn the exact strategies that took one man from rock bottom to $10M.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
                <h3>Lifetime Access</h3>
                <p>All courses, all updates, all future content. Pay once, learn forever. No subscription treadmill.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</body>
</html>
